This Terraform configuration sets up an Elastic Beanstalk environment named "myenv" with a connected RDS database named "myapp_db". It also configures a Route 53 zone and record to direct traffic to the Elastic Beanstalk environment. The IAM instance profile "eb_ec2_profile1" is created, although it is not directly used in this configuration. The subnet IDs for the RDS database subnet group should be replaced with valid subnet IDs from your AWS account.

