### Description of the Terraform Program

This Terraform program creates an AWS S3 bucket named `wellcomecollection-platform-infra` with the following configurations:
- The bucket ACL is set to 'private'.
- Versioning is enabled on the bucket.
- A lifecycle policy is configured to automatically delete objects with the 'tmp/' prefix after 30 days.
- Old versions of objects are transitioned to the 'STANDARD_IA' storage class after 30 days.
- Noncurrent versions are deleted after 90 days.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Specify your desired AWS region
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "wellcomecollection_platform_infra" {
  bucket = "wellcomecollection-platform-infra"
  acl    = "private"

  versioning {
    enabled = true
  }
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_acl" "wellcomecollection_platform_infra_acl" {
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.wellcomecollection_platform_infra.id
  acl    = "private"
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_lifecycle_configuration" "wellcomecollection_platform_infra_lifecycle" {
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.wellcomecollection_platform_infra.id

  rule {
    id     = "DeleteTmpObjects"
    prefix = "tmp/"
    status = "Enabled"

    expiration {
      days = 30
    }
  }

  rule {
    id     = "TransitionOldVersions"
    status = "Enabled"

    noncurrent_version_transition {
      days          = 30
      storage_class = "STANDARD_IA"
    }
  }

  rule {
    id     = "DeleteNoncurrentVersions"
    status = "Enabled"

    noncurrent_version_expiration {
      days = 90
    }
  }
}
```

This Terraform configuration ensures that the S3 bucket is created with the specified settings, including versioning and lifecycle policies, and the bucket ACL is set to private.

