### Description
This Terraform program creates an ElastiCache user group with three users. The user group and users are configured with the necessary attributes as per the AWS provider schema. The program ensures that the `engine` attribute is set correctly for both the user group and users, and that the `user_ids` attribute in the user group references the `user_id` of each user.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_elasticache_user_group" "elasticsearch_user_group" {
  engine       = "redis"
  user_group_id = "my-user-group"

