This Terraform program sets up a basic AWS Neptune cluster with a custom parameter group. The Neptune cluster is configured to only allow connections from two specified example subnets. The program includes the creation of a custom parameter group, a Neptune cluster, and a security group with appropriate ingress rules.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

# Custom Neptune Parameter Group
resource "aws_neptune_cluster_parameter_group" "neptune_custom_param_group" {
  family = "neptune1"

  parameter {
    name  = "neptune_query_timeout"
    value = "60000"
  }

  parameter {
    name  = "neptune_enable_audit_log"
    value = "1"
  }
}

# Security Group for Neptune Cluster
