  cluster_identifier       = "my-neptune-cluster"
  engine                   = "neptune"
  engine_version           = "1.2.0.1"
  neptune_cluster_parameter_group_name = aws_neptune_cluster_parameter_group.neptune_custom_param_group.name
  vpc_security_group_ids   = [aws_security_group.neptune_sg.id]
  skip_final_snapshot      = true
  iam_database_authentication_enabled = true
}
```

### Notes
- Ensure that the VPC ID (`vpc-12345678`) and subnet CIDRs (`10.0.1.0/24`, `10.0.2.0/24`) are replaced with the actual values from your AWS environment.
