This Terraform configuration sets up the necessary AWS resources to create a web service that allows users to upload cat pictures and retrieve random cat pictures. The resources include an IAM role for Lambda execution, two Lambda functions for handling uploads and retrievals, an S3 bucket for storing the cat pictures, and an API Gateway to expose the endpoints for these operations.

