### Description
This Terraform program creates an S3 Glacier vault and configures an AWS Data Lifecycle Manager (DLM) policy to manage the lifecycle of the Glacier vault. The DLM policy is set up to transition objects to Glacier after a specified number of days.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault" "my_glacier_vault" {
  name = "my-glacier-vault"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "dlm_execution_role" {
  name = "dlm-execution-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "dlm.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "dlm_policy_attachment" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.dlm_execution_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSDataLifecycleManagerDefaultRole"
}

resource "aws_dlm_lifecycle_policy" "my_dlm_policy" {
  description        = "DLM policy for managing Glacier vault"
  execution_role_arn = aws_iam_role.dlm_execution_role.arn

  policy_details {
    policy_type = "SCHEDULED"

    resource_types = ["VOLUME"]

    schedule {
      name = "weekly-backup-schedule"

      create_rule {
        interval      = 7
        interval_unit = "DAY"
        times         = ["23:45"]
      }

      retain_rule {
        count = 1
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Explanation
1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **Glacier Vault**: An S3 Glacier vault named `my-glacier-vault` is created.
3. **IAM Role for DLM**: An IAM role named `dlm-execution-role` is created with a trust policy allowing DLM to assume the role.
4. **IAM Policy Attachment**: The `AWSDataLifecycleManagerDefaultRole` policy is attached to the IAM role to grant the necessary permissions for DLM.
5. **DLM Lifecycle Policy**: A DLM policy is created to manage the lifecycle of the Glacier vault. The policy schedules weekly backups and retains one backup.

This configuration ensures that the DLM policy is correctly set up to interact with the Glacier vault.

